+# Northstar Standard Home Loan: team notes
+
+Document ID: B. These informal team notes were published on 2026-02-01 by the lending operations team. Their status is informal. They have no effective date and do not supersede another document. The lending operations team is not the Lending Policy Committee, and these notes are not policy approval.
+
+The discussion concerns Northstar Standard Home Loan owner-occupied purchase loans for standard individual borrowers in Northland, denominated in Northland dollars. It is about the same product and borrower class covered by policy A, rather than a separate product or exception.
+
+The maximum loan-to-value ratio (LTV) is 85%. That is the figure the team recorded during its discussion of the product. These notes do not state a maximum loan term or a minimum credit score.
+
+The notes record the team's statement, not a committee decision. No approval of a policy change accompanies this document. Its publication date identifies when the team recorded the statement; it is not an effective date for a revised lending policy. The document contains no instruction that it takes precedence over an approved policy.
